    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls:</strong><br><strong>Mouse:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click to move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click = Confirm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click = Cancel</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD or Arrow Keys (\u2191\u2190\u2193\u2192) to move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space or Enter = Confirm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc key = Cancel</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and keyboard controls can be used interchangeably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background Story:</strong><br>In the year 3011, humanity faces growing peril as monsters invade year after year. Fortunately, a group of Demon Hunters protects their kin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mo Jiu, the protagonist, is one of them. Though ranked at the lowest D-tier, he possesses a unique trait no one else has. One day, he encounters a &quot;Junk System&quot; robot that promises endless growth\u2014but forces him to scavenge for scrap. Wait... Why is there top-tier gear hidden in this junk pile?! Thus begins his legendary journey: growing stronger, recruiting allies, and battling monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Japanese-style RPG (JRPG) with turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command up to 4 characters in your party</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of equipment types, expansive maps, and 10,000+ words of story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protagonist can advance twice; some companions advance once</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize your team: 3-support/1-damage or full offensive synergy? Craft your imaginative party composition!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind levels, farm rare gear, and boost stats (continuously growing stats may eclipse equipment!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the main story, then challenge the post-game Supreme Tower!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Notes:</strong><br>Join our QQ group: <strong>973908965</strong> to share feedback, suggestions, or discuss the game with others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I develop the game entirely on my own, and this is my debut project. As a gamer with over a decade of experience (Bilibili: \u4ece\u96f6\u901a\u5173), I playtest every feature during development, refining anything that feels unsatisfying. I hope you enjoy the adventure\u2014your support means everything! Feedback is always welcome.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls:</strong><br><strong>Mouse:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click to move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click = Confirm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click = Cancel</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD or Arrow Keys (\u2191\u2190\u2193\u2192) to move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space or Enter = Confirm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc key = Cancel</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and keyboard controls can be used interchangeably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background Story:</strong><br>In the year 3011, humanity faces growing peril as monsters invade year after year. Fortunately, a group of Demon Hunters protects their kin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mo Jiu, the protagonist, is one of them. Though ranked at the lowest D-tier, he possesses a unique trait no one else has. One day, he encounters a &quot;Junk System&quot; robot that promises endless growth\u2014but forces him to scavenge for scrap. Wait... Why is there top-tier gear hidden in this junk pile?! Thus begins his legendary journey: growing stronger, recruiting allies, and battling monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Japanese-style RPG (JRPG) with turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command up to 4 characters in your party</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of equipment types, expansive maps, and 10,000+ words of story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protagonist can advance twice; some companions advance once</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize your team: 3-support/1-damage or full offensive synergy? Craft your imaginative party composition!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind levels, farm rare gear, and boost stats (continuously growing stats may eclipse equipment!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the main story, then challenge the post-game Supreme Tower!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Notes:</strong><br>Join our QQ group: <strong>973908965</strong> to share feedback, suggestions, or discuss the game with others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I develop the game entirely on my own, and this is my debut project. As a gamer with over a decade of experience (Bilibili: \u4ece\u96f6\u901a\u5173), I playtest every feature during development, refining anything that feels unsatisfying. I hope you enjoy the adventure\u2014your support means everything! Feedback is always welcome.</p>",
    "short_description": "A turn-based RPG with simple controls. Starting from &quot;scavenging junk&quot; with the help of a &quot;Junk System&quot; robot, you'll grow step by step to eventually battle formidable monsters. Experience a rich storyline, extensive equipment collections, and diverse map designs.",
